  What makes Star Storyteller selectable under
  Settings > Apps > Default apps > Digital assistant app.

  recognitionService is not optional: the platform parses this file when the app is offered as an
  assistant and rejects the whole configuration if it is absent, which would leave the app missing
  from that list with no other explanation.
-->
<voice-interaction-service
    xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:sessionService="com.google.ai.edge.gallery.voice.StarVoiceInteractionSessionService"
    android:recognitionService="com.google.ai.edge.gallery.voice.StarRecognitionService"
    android:supportsAssist="true"
    android:supportsLaunchVoiceAssistFromKeyguard="true" />
